  "m2_criterion": {
    "id": "M2_source_attested",
    "definition": "Current rights-cleared CRC Mongolia assignments with edition-specific five-digit and explicitly attested extended-code semantics, stable string identifiers, leading zeroes, Cyrillic names, validity, acquisition time, schema and SHA-256. Reconcile contradictory official counts and 2019/2024 standard descriptions without deleting legacy identifiers or treating syntax as assignment. Exact permitted geometry needs an explicit temporal postal relation, reviewed CRS, scale and topology; keep official/derived/virtual/none separate and no surface if absent. Independently permitted civic/building relations are mandatory for house numbers or buildings. Gazar grids, NSO administrative statistics and AGID remain separate namespaces. Real-record coverage, exceptions, privacy, reproducible transforms, rights snapshots, approved immutable digest-pinned data artifacts and the actual AGID loader/API must all pass."
  },
